Z||000000||mrfixit58||03-25-2000||06:15 PM||||I just got back from Daytona Speedway Spring Swap Meet and Car Show. Man, am I beat. But, the show was GREAT. The Fiero turnout was fantastic. Almost 200 cars. There were 3800s. V-8s, 3800 SC (met Phil), and even a NorthStar (WOW). I got a bunch of digital pictures and hope to post them soon.<P>As I mentioned, I got to meet our very own PHIL and got to see his SC3800 first hand. Very nice car and PHIL is quite a charactor. I made a couple of contacts for fiberglass GT 1/4 windows, left/right side scoops and some other neat stuff.<P>Anyway, I'm beat, sunburned,2 and my feet hurt. I'll post more later,<P>Roy L.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">||||reg||14
