Z||000002||mrfixit58||03-27-2000||09:19 PM||||sdm1964,<P>Likewise. Maybe next year we can all agree on a time and location to meet. I think it would be neat if we got a picture of each member standing by his car and post it on the forum. For those of us who were unabel to bring our cars, maybe a shot in front of Mr. Mikes tent or something.<P>Group Hug, say "cheeze"!!,  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Roy L.||||reg||7
